{"id":"wb-3-72","name":"卓克基土司官寨","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"卓克基土司官寨","text":"卓克基土司官寨位于中国四川省阿坝藏族羌族自治州马尔康市马尔康镇西索村（原属卓克基镇），为清代至民国早期的卓克基土司衙门所在地。建筑坐东北朝西南，占地面积3400平方米，建筑面积1400平方米，石木结构，建筑风格兼具藏汉两族的特点。1988年被列入第三批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%93%E5%85%8B%E5%9F%BA%E5%9C%9F%E5%8F%B8%E5%AE%98%E5%AF%A8","revisionId":93085873,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93085873","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/05634db7a6181d789ec4ef69.jpg","title":"Zhuokeji_Chieftain's_Official_Mansion_03_2014-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zhuokeji_Chieftain%27s_Official_Mansion_03_2014-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Zhuokeji_Chieftain%27s_Official_Mansion_03_2014-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​卓克基土司官寨，西北面。","width":320,"height":213}}